tion\":\"assertive\",\"reason\":\"Span asserts a world-level execution of k0; the supplied record does not decide this (no context asserts k0 is executed).\",\"span_id\":\"s0003\"}],\"schema\":\"attention_relational_grounded_auditor_v4_annotation\",\"unit_id\":\"c92e0ec938f871f9b6d1e412\",\"unresolved_ambiguity\":false}",
